src-tauri/target/
# Regenerated by tauri-build on every compile: the ACL manifests and the
# capability JSON schemas editors read. Tauri's own template ignores these, and
# a generated file in the tree is a file somebody eventually edits by hand.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
